  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThis issue tracks upstreaming the relevant parts from the Document Picture-in-Picture API spec.\n\nI suggest we merge the monkey patches to `definitely close`, `destroy`, `navigate`, `focus()`, `activation notification` as well as `consume user activation` and move sections 3 to 6 over to HTML.\n\nhttps://github.com/WICG/document-picture-in-picture/issues/147",
